 "remarks": "Experience turnkey luxury living in this beautifully appointed townhouse offering nearly 3,000 square feet across four finished levels. The main level features 9-foot ceilings, hardwood floors, custom wainscoting and a spacious living room with gas fireplace. The high-end chef's kitchen features custom white cabinetry, quartzite countertops, Thermador appliances including a 6-burner dual-fuel range, refrigerator, wine cooler and microwave, plus an oversized island with seating for 3-4. Sliders open to the yard and bluestone patio for easy indoor/outdoor living. Upstairs, the primary suite features a walk-in closet and luxurious Carrera marble bath with radiant heated floors, freestanding soaking tub, double vanity and oversized shower. Two additional bedrooms, a full bath with heated floors and LG washer and dryer complete the second level. The third floor offers two additional rooms and a half bath, ideal for a home office, playroom or den. The finished lower level provides even more flexible living space with a full bath with radiant heated floors and additional storage. Additional features include Lutron lighting, separate climate zones on each floor, a Ring alarm system plus a hardwired state-of-the-art security system connected to police and fire, hardwood floors throughout the first three levels, an attached one-car garage and one assigned parking space. Offered fully furnished or unfurnished.",
